# The turtle starts in the middle facing up. Each side is a little longer than
# the one before, and a turn of 89 degrees instead of 90 makes the square drift
# into a spiral. Run it with `goat run examples/spiral.goat -o spiral.svg`.
color("purple");
for side from 1 to 60 do
  forward(side * 3);
  right(89)
done
